PRIMARY LOCALITY / LATENCY RESULT
A target-free demand signal can guide resource from:
purely local field measurements.

But the useful gradient must physically propagate far enough.

Thus:

NO GLOBAL TARGET COORDINATE

does not mean:

NO INFORMATION-PROPAGATION COST.

This is the decentralized price of locality.

