PRIMARY STIGMERGIC-POISON NEGATIVE
Repeated traffic is NOT sufficient evidence that a transport path deserves slow reinforcement.

A false demand source can train:
a bad resource vasculature

even though every local routing step was consistent with the current demand field.

Thus:

RESOURCE FLOW
IS NOT
FUNCTIONAL RESOURCE VALUE.

CONSEQUENCE-GATED POSITIVE
If slow transport reinforcement requires:
successful functional uptake / consequence,

the false emitter creates:
NO persistent path memory

in this stress.

Subsequent real-target performance is identical to:
no reinforcement.

This is the transport analogue of:
H12 structural causal validation
and
H41 template functional validation.

